{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":22128220,"ns":0,"title":"Baffle (heat transfer)","extract":"Baffles are flow-directing or obstructing vanes or panels used to direct a flow of liquid or gas. It is used in some household stoves and in some industrial process vessels (tanks), such as shell and tube heat exchangers, chemical reactors, and static mixers.","description":"Fluid-flow-directing vane or panel","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}